{"name":"Blumine","hex":"#305c71","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Blumine Island","blocks":[{"text":"Blumine Island / Ōruawairua is an island in the outer reaches of Queen Charlotte Sound / Tōtaranui, in the Marlborough Sounds, at the northern end of New Zealand's South Island. It is 400 metres off the much larger Arapaoa Island."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/New_zealand_king_shag.jpg/330px-New_zealand_king_shag.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blumine_Island"},{"title":"Sartor Resartus","blocks":[{"text":"Sartor Resartus: The Life and Opinions of Herr Teufelsdröckh in Three Books is a novel by the Scottish essayist, historian and philosopher Thomas Carlyle, first serialised in Fraser's Magazine from November 1833 to August 1834. It purports to be a commentary on the thought and early life of a German philosopher called Diogenes Teufelsdröckh, author of a tome entitled Clothes: Their Origin and Influence. Teufelsdröckh's transcendentalist musings are mulled over by a skeptical English Reviewer who also provides fragmentary biographical material on the philosopher. The work is a parody, in part of Georg Wilhelm Friedrich Hegel and more generally of German idealism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Title_page_of_Sartor_Resartus.jpg/330px-Title_page_of_Sartor_Resartus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sartor_Resartus"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Okarito_kiwi_2.jpg/500px-Okarito_kiwi_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Okarito_kiwi_2.jpg/500px-Okarito_kiwi_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A rowi (Ōkārito kiwi) on the island","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOkarito_kiwi_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg/500px-Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg/1280px-Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg/500px-Picture_of_Carlyle%27s_Craigenputtock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Craigenputtock House","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APicture_of_Carlyle's_Craigenputtock.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg/500px-Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg/1280px-Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg/500px-Room_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Room in which Sartor Resartus was written","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARoom_in_Which_%22Sartor_Resartus%22_Was_Written.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Portrait_of_Meijer_de_Haan.jpg/500px-Portrait_of_Meijer_de_Haan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wi